# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build
/build/
/build.nosync
/build.nosync/
/coverage/

# iCloud-sync escape: symlinks + .nosync directories keep gradle/flutter
# build caches outside the iCloud-synced tree so AGP doesn't see " 2.png"
# duplicates. Ignore both the symlink and the real .nosync target.
*.nosync
*.nosync/
/android/.gradle
/android/.gradle/
/android/.gradle.nosync
/android/.gradle.nosync/
/android/app/build
/android/app/build/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release
